<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/0.1.0> .
