# 
# 
# http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
# 
# https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasAATReference
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasAATReference> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasAATReference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Associates an ontology class with a corresponding concept in the Getty Art & Architecture Thesaurus (AAT) as a terminological reference. This annotation supports terminology reuse and traceability without asserting semantic equivalence or a formal class-level mapping."@en .
