# https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/adjacentTo
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/adjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/adjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P122_borders_with> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/adjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/adjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/ArchitecturalSpace> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/adjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/ArchitecturalSpace> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/adjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is adjacent to"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/adjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Relates two distinct spaces that meet at a common boundary. The relation reads in either direction and does not require a doorway between the spaces."@en .
# 
# https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/bounds
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/bounds> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/bounds> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/ArchitecturalElement> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/bounds> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/ArchitecturalSpace> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/bounds> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "bounds"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/bounds> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Relates an architectural element to a space whose boundary it defines in whole or in part."@en .
# 
