<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsArchitecturalSpace> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsArchitecturalSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P89i_contains> .
