<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsArchitecturalSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/ArchitecturalSpace> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsArchitecturalSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "contains architectural space"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsArchitecturalSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Relates a storey to an architectural space lying within its spatial extent."@en .
# 
# https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsElement
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsElement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P53i_is_former_or_current_location_of> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsElement> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/isContainedAsAnElementIn> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/ArchitecturalSpace> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/ArchitecturalElement> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "contains element"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsElement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Records an architectural element located within the space. Boundary elements are documented with is bounded by when that is the observed relationship."@en .
# 
# https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsSculpture
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/containsSculpture> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
