<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalDecorationType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/ArchitecturalDecorationType> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalDecorationType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has architectural decoration type"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalDecorationType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Classifies a decorative feature by a recorded aspect of its medium, form or motif."@en .
# 
