<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/Building> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/ArchitecturalSpace> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has architectural space"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalSpace> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Relates a building to an identifiable architectural space belonging to it. This relation can describe a space extending across several storeys."@en .
# 
# https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalStratigraphicUnit
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalStratigraphicUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
