<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalStratigraphicUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/ArchitecturalElement> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalStratigraphicUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/ArchitecturalStratigraphicUnit> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalStratigraphicUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has architectural stratigraphic unit"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasArchitecturalStratigraphicUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Relates an element to a recognisable portion of its fabric interpreted as evidence of construction, repair or alteration."@en .
