<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/hasComponentID> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Associates an instance of E24 Physical Human-Made Thing or E53 Place with a component identifier assigned within a particular recording system. In AHKTO this covers physical architectural entities and spatial entities; the domain is the union of the two CRM classes."@en .
