<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/isArchitecturalStyleOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is architectural style of"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/isArchitecturalStyleOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Inverse of ahkto:hasArchitecturalStyle. Read from the object to the subject: This property relates a building or an architectural element to an architectural style that characterises its formal composition, design principles, or decorative expression. Different architectural styles may be associated with the same building or element, reflecting stylistic variations, historical alterations, or later interventions. The assignment represents a stylistic classification and does not necessarily indicate the date of construction.."@en .
