<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/isClassicalOrderOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is classical order of"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/isClassicalOrderOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Inverse of ahkto:hasClassicalOrder. Read from the object to the subject: This property relates an architectural element to a classical architectural order identified through its formal characteristics, proportions, and decorative details. It supports the classification of elements associated with the Doric, Ionic, Corinthian, Tuscan, or Composite orders, including columns, pilasters, capitals, and entablatures. The assignment reflects the architectural characteristics of the element and does not necessarily imply that it belongs to a complete classical order system."@en .
