<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/isVaultTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/isVaultTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2i_is_type_of> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/isVaultTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/VaultType> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/isVaultTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/Vault> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/isVaultTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is vault type of"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/isVaultTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Inverse of ahkto:hasVaultType. Read from the object to the subject: Assigns a geometric or structural category to an individual vault."@en .
