# https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/PointCloud
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/PointCloud> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/PointCloud> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/PointCloud> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Point Cloud"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/PointCloud> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This class comprises identifiable digital information resources representing three-dimensional spatial information through collections of discrete points defined by spatial coordinates and, where available, additional attributes such as color, intensity, or surface classification. Point clouds may be generated through terrestrial laser scanning, photogrammetry, or other spatial data acquisition and processing techniques. They may represent surveyed architectural conditions, reconstructed historical configurations, or digitally generated design geometries. The class is distinguished from surface-based or parametric geometric models by its point-based spatial representation and is independent of the file format or acquisition method."@en .
