# 
# https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/Video
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/Video> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/Video> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object> .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/Video> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Video"@en .
<https://wanqin-liu.github.io/ahkto/Video> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This class comprises identifiable information resources consisting of sequences of visual images intended to represent motion or changes over time, with or without accompanying sound. It includes audiovisual documentation, historical footage, survey recordings, animations, and digital presentations related to architectural heritage. Video resources may represent existing buildings, construction or conservation activities, historical transformations, proposed designs, or hypothetical reconstructions. The class is independent of the recording device, production technique, file format, and factual status of the represented content."@en .
